msgid "`an element of a list is either a criterion or one step, not both`"
msgstr "`an element of a list is either a criterion or one step, not both`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-yaml.md
msgid "one list element mixing selection keys and a step key"
msgstr "um elemento de lista que mistura chaves de seleção e uma chave de passo"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-yaml.md
msgid ""
"`duplicate key: two keys of this mapping name the same step; write the "
