msgstr "uma página ou passo repetidos num mapping, inclusive `21`/`\"21\"`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-yaml.md
msgid "`not a format pattern: …`"
msgstr "`not a format pattern: …`"

#: ../../source/reference/formats/document-classify-yaml.md
#, python-brace-format
